OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Saints defender opens up about
OL,4,Amental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former footballer has said he was
OL,7,Fbrought up "not to cry" or show
OL,8,Fweakness as he opened up about his
OL,9,Fmental health.
OL,11,FMark Dennis, who played at left-back
OL,12,Ffor Southampton from 1983 to 1987, said
OL,13,F"mental illness has really hit home to
OL,14,Fme now" and that he had been "wearing
OL,15,Fmasks" throughout his life in a video
OL,16,Fshared to Instagram on Thursday.
OL,18,FThe 65-year-old, who also played for
OL,19,FBirmingham City and Queens Park
OL,20,FRangers, said he was being supported by
OL,21,Fthe Saints' mental health team.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
